Redrob Shape is written from scratch. It is not derived from Blender or any other 3D suite.
The earlier Blender-based distribution that lived in this repository is preserved under the git
tag `blender-fork-final` and the branch `archive/blender-fork-history`; Blender is licensed under
the GNU GPL v3 and nothing from it is carried in this tree.

Brand assets under assets/brand are the published Redrob design-system files, pinned by SHA-256 in
assets/brand/SOURCES.json.
